decision_flow:
flowchart TD
  A{Call failed?} -->|No| B[Read the stream or result]
  A -->|Yes| C{Status 400 or 401?}
  C -->|Yes| D[Fix request or key first]
  C -->|No| E{Retry-after header present?}
  E -->|Yes| F[Wait and retry within a limit]
  E -->|No| G{Spend cap message?}
  G -->|Yes| H[Raise limit or tier and do not retry]
  G -->|No| I[Backoff retry and log request ID]
